cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "Dutch Marquise: Open Geometry Specification"
abstract: >-
  An open, versioned, machine-readable specification for the Dutch Marquise
  diamond cut and its companion the French Marquise: outline, faceting pattern,
  certificate nomenclature, and length-to-width ratio, every claim sourced.
  Published by Stienhardt & Stones, which cuts these stones in-house.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Stienhardt & Stones"
    website: "https://stienhardt.com"
    city: "New York"
    country: "US"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-16"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/stienhardt/dutch-marquise-spec"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stienhardt/dutch-marquise-spec"
keywords:
  - "Dutch Marquise"
  - "French Marquise"
  - "diamond cut"
  - "modified marquise brilliant"
  - "elongated hexagon"
  - "lab-grown diamond"
  - "gemology"
